# inc-k0e1: wizard-summon a goblin directly east of the player, then attack east.
# The probe (INCURSION_CLEAVE_ILLUSION_PROBE) gives the player Cleave, spawns a real
# bugbear beside the player, holds the goblin at 1 HP and, in illusion mode, makes it
# an illusion.
@include chargen.keys
.*2
w
y
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Goblinkin"
@choose "goblin"
RIGHT ENTER
RIGHT
.*2
RIGHT
.*2
RIGHT
.*2
@dump:end
